# STM32CubeIDE build configurations (generated output)
**/Debug/
**/Release/

# Eclipse / STM32CubeIDE workspace state and local history
**/.metadata/
**/.recommenders/
**/.history/
**/RemoteSystemsTempFiles/
**/.DS_Store

# Compiler, linker, and debugger output
*.o
*.obj
*.d
*.su
*.cyclo
*.elf
*.axf
*.out
*.map
*.list
*.lst
*.hex
*.bin
*.srec
*.s19
