*.gcno

# Editor backups and temporary files
*~
*.bak
*.tmp
*.swp
*.swo

# OS-generated files
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Keep project definitions and build inputs under version control:
#   *.ioc                      CubeMX configuration
#   .project, .cproject         CubeIDE project and build configuration
#   .settings/, *.launch        Project settings and debug configurations
#   .mxproject                 CubeMX generation metadata
#   Core/, Drivers/, Middlewares/, USB_DEVICE/, FATFS/, etc.
#   Startup files, linker scripts (*.ld), and any custom build files
# Generated source is intentionally kept so a clone can build immediately.
